  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></math>, is such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></math> is equal to",
